{"title":"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are positive <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Integer\" title=\"Integer\">integers</a> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/f/7cf6f8fa48b22def853a427ff1d67020201621dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75m = n^{3}$\" width=\"75\" height=\"15\" />. What is the minimum possible value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/b/53bf1afcb274a3bb84338109fffec8a1f1c02008.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m + n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/f/a7f3ee7e10ebd4f754902f39f43e6afc3b960cb1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)}\\ 15 \\qquad \\text{(B)}\\ 30 \\qquad \\text{(C)}\\ 50 \\qquad \\text{(D)}\\ 60 \\qquad \\text{(E)}\\ 5700$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"396\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cb19b964390f57a444060ef1077b55a50fadfe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 5^2m$\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" /> must be a perfect cube, so each power of a prime in the factorization for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/b/2cb19b964390f57a444060ef1077b55a50fadfe9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 \\cdot 5^2m$\" width=\"54\" height=\"15\" /> must be divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus the minimum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/9/bf9cd891fca223c463dd1f35ef5ead2c85744804.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3^2 \\cdot 5 = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"80\" height=\"15\" />, which makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/2/8b219ec60fc52fffb3a087cd962705121a553544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = \\sqrt[3]{3^3 \\cdot 5^3} = 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"139\" height=\"18\" />. The minimum possible value for the sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/3/753f6667acf70ab315dfc8dc1d0958986e1415b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {(D)60}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"66\" height=\"32\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First, we need to prime factorize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/e/a7e4c2930d79c57bee209557767b878cd704ea46.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/2/68209f3c4dff7c50a30e66fc09f8c6b579f394fb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^2 \\cdot 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"17\" />. We need <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/c/4ac513592bd877eb807a53d88deefaedab637f4a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75m$\" width=\"33\" height=\"12\" /> to be in the form <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/4/9848f0c3cdc3f23cd80d86189319937f709fc8bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x^3y^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" />. Therefore, the smallest <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/a/2/4a29c8656e2c115aed2fe9156b165d6f702f7811.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 \\cdot 3^2$\" width=\"37\" height=\"15\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> = 45, and since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/b/d/3bd60b595daae109ea23e0ed38840822692e12e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5^3 \\cdot 3^3 = 15^3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"98\" height=\"17\" />, our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/a/5ea3bf55e379b09acf36eb56ef1f5230ac726d96.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45 + 15$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"60\" height=\"15\" /> = <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/8/ad8bf9e78f944bb79daf11abfc84e33adc5f71e1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed {(D)60}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"61\" height=\"32\" />\n</p><p>~Arcticturn\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A\">2007 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_16\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 16\">Problem 16</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 18\">Problem 18</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_7\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_8\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2007 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit